  "title": "capture: Don't define static get_unix_sdl_type fxn on _WIN32",
  "description": "The static function get_unix_sdl_type is not used when\n_WIN32 is defined, leading to an warning when compiling on\nWindows with some compilers, e.g., clang-cl, gcc (MSYS2),\nor cross-compiling:\n\nhttps://github.com/wireshark/wireshark/actions/runs/24329372102/job/71031456883\n\n```shell\nD:/a/wireshark/wireshark/capture/capture-pcap-util.c:184:12: error: 'get_unix_sdl_type' defined but not used [-Werror=unused-function]\n  184 | static int get_unix_sdl_type(const char *ifname _U_)\n      |            ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\ncc1.exe: all warnings being treated as errors\n```\n\nFixup 6ef0555e64a5d18d27fdacee9b576b879c12c7b0\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
